WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:06.350
The identity engineers who run Chapter
6's write path and own the standard.

3
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:11.288
